            <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-3">1. The Hidden Epidemic: Common Worms in Pakistani Cats</h2>
            <p>
              Intestinal parasites are omnipresent in Pakistani cats and kittens. Due to warm ambient temperatures and high flea populations in cities like Lahore, Rawalpindi, and Karachi, virtually every kitten is born with or contracts worms through the mother's milk (transmammary transmission).
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3">
              The four major feline parasites include:
            </p>
