                Many amateur pet owners in Pakistan attempt to save money by purchasing <strong>Zentel (Albendazole)</strong> or <strong>Vermox (Mebendazole)</strong> human deworming syrups from local human pharmacies.
              </p>
              <p>
                Feline liver metabolism lacks the essential glucuronyl transferase enzyme pathways. In cats, Albendazole causes <strong>bone marrow aplasia, severe leukopenia (plummeting white blood cells), anorexia, and acute hepatic failure</strong>. Dozens of cats die in Pakistan every year from human Zentel administration. Always buy PVMC-approved veterinary dewormers like Feli-Worm.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

